:::

```{.r .cell-code}
data1 <- data.frame(
  ID = 1:5,
  Name = c("Alice", "Bob", "Charlie", "David", "Eva")
)
data2 <- data.frame(
  ID = c(2, 3, 5, 6),
  Score = c(85, 90, 88, 92)
)

inner_join(data1, data2, by = "ID")
```

